rk Mode : On-Campus Position - Employees in this position are expected to work on-campus during regularly scheduled work hours due to the nature of the work being that which is not feasible, or not in the best interest of the organization, to be performed remotely. #LI-DNI Hourly Rate:   $17.00 / per hour We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate in hiring or employment on the basis of race, color, creed, religion or belief, national or ethnic origin, citizenship status, marital or domestic partnership status, sexual orientation, sex, gender identity or expression, age, disability, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local law. The New School recognizes and values the benefits of a diverse workforce. Responsibilities: Provide a high level of customer service, assist students and faculty with reservations and equipment requests , assist Making Center Staff with shop upkeep, organization, and maintenance, perform regular upkeep of shops and spaces to maintain organization and cleanliness,  and complete special projects as assigned. We look forward to receiving your application!"
